/* [wxMaxima: comment start ]
Relações Constitutivas I 
12/05/2026
Prof. Eduardo Lenz Cardoso - eduardo.cardoso@udesc.br
Universidade do Estado de Santa Catarina - UDESC
Centro de Ciencias Tecnologicas - CCT

Criterio de Falha de Tsai-Wu
   [wxMaxima: comment end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
kill(all)$
load(draw)$
ratprint: false $
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: comment start ]
Equacao Geral do Criterio de Falha Quadratico no espaco das tensoes
   [wxMaxima: comment end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
falha_quadratico: F_1*s1 + F_2*s2 + 2*F_12*s1*s2 + F_11*s1**2 + F_22*s2**2 + F_66*s3**2 = 1;
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: comment start ]
Ensaio Uniaxal em 1 (direcao X local)
   [wxMaxima: comment end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
eq1: ev(falha_quadratico,[s1=X,   s2=0, s3=0]);
eq2: ev(falha_quadratico,[s1=-Xc, s2=0, s3=0]);
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: comment start ]
Ensaio Uniaxial em 2 (direcao Y local)
   [wxMaxima: comment end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
eq3: ev(falha_quadratico,[s1=0, s2=Y,   s3=0]);
eq4: ev(falha_quadratico,[s1=0, s2=-Yc, s3=0]);
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: comment start ]
Ensaio de Cisalhamento
   [wxMaxima: comment end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
eq5: ev(falha_quadratico,[s1=0, s2=0, s3=S]);
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: comment start ]
Assim, 
   [wxMaxima: comment end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
termos_1: solve([eq1,eq2],[F_1,F_11]);
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
termos_2: solve([eq3,eq4],[F_2,F_22]);
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
termos_3: solve([eq5],[F_66]);
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: comment start ]
Finalmente, conforme proposto por Tsai, podemos escrever o termo de acoplamento como 
   [wxMaxima: comment end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
F12_Tsai: F_12 = ev(F_12a*sqrt(F_11*F_22),[termos_1,termos_2]);
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: comment start ]
#################################################
####                      CRITERIO DE TSAI-WU                               ####
#################################################
   [wxMaxima: comment end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
Tsai_Wu: ev(falha_quadratico,[termos_1, termos_2, termos_3, F12_Tsai]);
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: comment start ]
Como visualizar esta equacao ? Montamos 3 vistas:

1) Plano 6 - 2 (cisalhamento - Y)
2) Plano 1 - 2 (X- Y)
3) Plano 1 - 6 (X - cisalhamento)
   [wxMaxima: comment end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
plano_62: ev(Tsai_Wu,s1=0);
plano_12: ev(Tsai_Wu,s3=0);
plano_16: ev(Tsai_Wu,s2=0);
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: comment start ]
e, como exemplo, utilizar os seguintes dados experimentais (Em MPa)
   [wxMaxima: comment end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
experimental: [X = 1062, Xc = 610, Y = 31, Yc = 118, S = 72, F_12a =  -0.5];
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: comment start ]
Agora vamos ao show .. disciplina  Plot1001....

1) Substituimos os dados experimentais nas equacoes dos planos...
   [wxMaxima: comment end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
eq62: ev(plano_62, experimental);
eq12: ev(plano_12, experimental);
eq16: ev(plano_16, experimental);
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: comment start ]
Agora definimos os comandos graficos para cada um dos planos....
   [wxMaxima: comment end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
p62: gr2d(      grid       = true,
                line_type  = solid,
                color      = red ,     
                key        = "Plano 12",
                xlabel     = "S12",
                ylabel     = "S22",
                implicit(eq62 , s3, -100, 100, s2, -150, 150)
 )$

p12: gr2d(      grid       = true,
                line_type  = solid,
                color      = red ,     
                key        = "Plano 12",
                xlabel     = "S11",
                ylabel     = "S22",
                implicit(eq12 , s1, -2000, 2000, s2, -150, 150)
 )$

p16: gr2d(      grid       = true,
                line_type  = solid,
                color      = red ,     
                key        = "Plano 16",
                xlabel     = "S11",
                ylabel     = "S12",
                implicit(eq16 , s1, -2000, 2000, s3, -100, 100)
 )$
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: comment start ]
Agora plotamos na forma mostrada em aula...

Para plotar para um arquivo, podemos adicionar as seguintes linhas dentro do draw

terminal   = png,
pic_width  = 800,
pic_height = 600,
   [wxMaxima: comment end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
wxdraw(
     columns    = 2,
     p62, p12, p16)$
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: comment start ]
sxx = 500 / 500
syy = -50 / 50
sxy = 50 / 50



#################################################
###                             RESISTENCIA                               ####
#################################################
   [wxMaxima: comment end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
eqR: ev(Tsai_Wu,[s1=R*s1r, s2=R*s2r, s3=R*s3r])=1;
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: comment start ]
Soluciona para R, considerando os dados experimentais
   [wxMaxima: comment end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
Rs: float(solve( ev(eqR,experimental),R));
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: comment start ]
E podemos verificar pelos graficos .. so vale o positivo...
   [wxMaxima: comment end   ] */


/* [wxMaxima: input   start ] */
float(ev(Rs, [s1r = 500, 
                    s2r = -100,
                    s3r = 100]));
/* [wxMaxima: input   end   ] */



